\c 1
\s1 The exiles send gifts and a message to Yerushalem
\p
\v 1 These are the¦45965 words¦45966 of¦45967 the¦45967 book¦45968 which¦45969 Baruk the son¦45972 of Neriyah, the son¦45974 of Mahseyah, the son¦45976 of Tsidkiyah \add !(Zedekiah)\add*, the son¦45978 of Hasadyah, the son¦45980 of Hilkiyah, wrote¦45970 in¦45982 Bavel \add !(Babylon)\add*,
\v 2 in¦45984 the¦45985 fifth year¦45986, in the seventh¦45990 day of¦45991 the¦45991 month, at the¦45994 time¦45995 when the Kasdim \add !(Chaldeans)\add* took¦45997 Yerushalem \add !(Jerusalem)\add* and¦46002 burnt it¦46004 with fire¦46006.
\v 3 Baruk read the¦46010 words¦46011 of¦46012 this¦46014 book in¦46015 the hearing of Yekonias the son¦46018 of Yehoyakim king¦46020 of Yehudah \add !(Judah)\add*, and¦46022 in¦46023 the hearing of all¦46025 the¦46026 people¦46027 who¦46028 came¦46029 to¦46030 hear the¦46031 book,
