\v 7 and¦46081 they sent¦46082 it to¦46082 Yerushalem to¦46085 Yehoyakim the high priest, the son of Hilkiyah, the son of Shalum, and¦46093 to¦46094 the¦46095 priests¦46096 and¦46097 to¦46098 all¦46099 the¦46100 people¦46101 who¦46102 were found with¦46104 him at Yerushalem,
\v 8 at the¦46109 same time when he¦46111 took¦46110 the¦46112 vessels¦46113 of the¦46116 master's house¦46114, that'd been carried out¦46118 of¦46119 the¦46119 temple¦46120, to return them into the land¦46123 of Yehudah, the¦46125 tenth¦46126 day of¦46127 Sivan—silver¦46130 vessels which¦46131 Tsidkiyah the son¦46134 of Yoshiyah \add !(Josiah)\add* king¦46136 of Yehudah had made¦46132,
