\s1 The people confess their disobedience
\p
\v 15 Say¦46310: To the¦46311 master our god¦46313 belongs righteousness¦46316, but¦46318 to us confusion of face¦46321, as at this¦46323 day¦46324—to the¦46329 men of Yehudah, to¦46330 the inhabitants¦46330 of Yerushalem,
