\v 17 Open¦46819 your eyes¦46820, and¦46822 see¦46823; for the dead that¦46824 are in¦46828 Haidais, whose breath¦46834 is taken from¦46836 their bodies, will give¦46840 to the master neither glory¦46841 nor righteousness¦46843;
