\v 19 Because¦46875 we don't¦46879 present our supplication before you¦46893, Oh master our god¦46896, for the¦46880 righteousness of our fathers¦46881 and¦46883 of our kings¦46885.
\v 20 Because¦46898 you've¦46902 sent your anger and¦46903 your indignation onto us, as¦46909 you've¦46915 spoken by your servants the¦46916 prophets¦46917, saying,
